WEBVTT

00:10:59.746 --> 00:11:04.454
And, you know, I never go into anything
with a kind of template

00:11:04.454 --> 00:11:06.246
for what it should or shouldn't be.

00:11:06.454 --> 00:11:10.329
I feel like I've learned a ton
of lessons along the way.

00:11:10.579 --> 00:11:13.579
And by the way, I always feel like
we're carrying, you know,

00:11:13.579 --> 00:11:17.037
whatever a thousand lessons with us
that we all need to, you know,

00:11:17.037 --> 00:11:20.204
remember at all times. But we can
only really carry 900 of them.

00:11:20.579 --> 00:11:23.662
And we're constantly dropping
lessons and picking up

00:11:23.662 --> 00:11:25.704
the ones that we've dropped
in by picking those up.

00:11:25.704 --> 00:11:29.746
We've dropped some other ones and we
keep relearning the same thing.

00:11:29.746 --> 00:11:32.954
So I think, you know, rethinking is
really important and relearning is